# Resume kit

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `STYLE.md`. They are the system for Cursor and for every other agent. Do not require a Cursor-only model slug, Task, or slash command. The same requests are "set me up" and `/setup`, "tailor this" and `/tailor`.

If `candidate_profile.json` has `setup_complete` false, follow `docs/setup.md` and stop. Do not tailor the placeholder.

House style, in force even before you open `STYLE.md`: one sentence per bullet, outcome required, at most two bold spans, lexicon echo only for work they have, no city in the header, no fabricated metric. Claim limits in `experience.md` win over examples in `STYLE.md`.
